Dense class 0: full 4.272092; baseline -0.268864; Shapley sum 4.540956; residual 1.78e-15; LIME weighted R2 0.976317; fitted full 4.139875.
Signed correlations: dense LIME/Shapley 0.996709; dense/CNN Shapley for fixed class 0 0.130137.
